sections.body:
To secure the Loan, Borrower grants Lender a security interest in the following collateral and its proceeds:

{{collateral}}

Borrower authorizes Lender to file a UCC financing statement and will sign any document reasonably needed to perfect it, including a lien notation on a title. Borrower will not sell, move or encumber the collateral without Lender's written consent. On default, Lender has the rights of a secured party under Article 9 of the Uniform Commercial Code, including the right to take and sell the collateral after required notices.
